OL,3,AChina resumes rescue efforts at
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border after fears of
OL,5,Asecond flood halted operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FChinese authorities have resumed rescue
OL,8,Fefforts near the Nepal-Tibet border,
OL,9,Fstate media says, after fears that a
OL,10,Fnewly formed lake of rising water could
OL,11,Fburst its banks halted operations
OL,13,FState media says an "overflow"
OL,14,Foccurred, and water had been trickling
OL,15,Fout
OL,17,FThe death toll has now risen to 475,
OL,18,FNepal Police says, more than 48 hours
OL,19,Fafter flash flooding devastated the
OL,20,FHimalayan border region
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
