OL,3,AChina resumes rescue efforts at
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border after fears of
OL,5,Asecond flood halted operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, three people have died and
OL,8,Fmore than 550 are missing. It is not
OL,9,Fclear if the latest figures overlap
OL,11,FRescuers searching for survivors are
OL,12,F"on edge" over the reports that a
OL,13,Fsecond flood could hit the disaster
OL,14,Fzone, a Red Cross official tells the
OL,15,FBBC
OL,17,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,18,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,19,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,20,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,21,Fborder crossing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
